## Scope / 适用范围

**MIT applies to code only** — the site (HTML/CSS/JS) and the build tooling (Python):

- midicn/midi-lib-site : site pages, styles, client scripts, build scripts (tools/)
- midicn/midi-lib      : build & packaging scripts

**Metadata produced by this project** (catalog.json, indexes, category and source
notes) is licensed under **CC BY 4.0** — attribution only:

    midicn-lib metadata © 2026 midicn-lib contributors, licensed CC BY 4.0
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

**MIDI material is NOT relicensed here.** Every track keeps the licence of its
upstream source (see the sources page and the per-track `l` field in catalog.json).
This project claims no rights over that material and cannot grant rights to it.
